{"seq":3,"slug":"agreement-rate-best-eligibility","title":"多协定税率选择与最优享惠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-determination-data/agreement-rate-best-eligibility","wordCount":1881,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"多协定税率选择与最优享惠\">多协定税率选择与最优享惠</h1><p>一批蓝牙耳机在越南组装，用中国电芯、韩国屏幕、日本外壳。它同时符合 RCEP 与东盟内部 ATIGA 两个协定的原产资格，目的国关税在 RCEP 下是 5%、ATIGA 下是 0%，但 ATIGA 的证书只能在东盟成员间流转。选哪个协定，不是「有 RCEP 就用 RCEP」的直觉题，而是一次带约束的最优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>择优的本质是：在满足所有约束的协定集合里，选出让「净节省」最大的那一个。净节省不只是税率差，还要减去达成原产资格的代价与开证成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选协定集合] --&gt; B[原产资格过滤]&#10;  B --&gt; C[税率比较]&#10;  C --&gt; D[达成难度评估]&#10;  D --&gt; E[开证成本与时效]&#10;  E --&gt; F[约束校验]&#10;  F --&gt; G[净节省排序]&#10;  G --&gt; H[选定协定]&#10;  H --&gt; I[触发对应凭证流程]\">graph TD\n  A[候选协定集合] --&gt; B[原产资格过滤]\n  B --&gt; C[税率比较]\n  C --&gt; D[达成难度评估]\n  D --&gt; E[开证成本与时效]\n  E --&gt; F[约束校验]\n  F --&gt; G[净节省排序]\n  G --&gt; H[选定协定]\n  H --&gt; I[触发对应凭证流程]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策维度</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协定税率</td>\n<td>目标国在该协定下的适用税率</td>\n<td>关税表 + 协定减让表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原产资格</td>\n<td>该协定下是否已判定合格</td>\n<td>判定引擎结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>达成难度</td>\n<td>从「不合格」到「合格」所需改动</td>\n<td>规则表达式 + 当前缺口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开证成本</td>\n<td>签证费、时间、人力</td>\n<td>单证系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效约束</td>\n<td>能否在出运前拿到凭证</td>\n<td>签证时效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互惠约束</td>\n<td>该协定是否对该流向生效</td>\n<td>协定成员与生效状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"税率比较的正确基准\">税率比较的正确基准</h2><h3 id=\"三方税率对照\">三方税率对照</h3><p>享惠的实际收益是「协定税率」相对「基准税率」的差额。基准税率通常是目的国的最惠国税率（MFN），但有三种情形会让基准变化：目的国对同类货已有更低的单边优惠、货物属于零关税品类、或货物同时受反倾销措施影响而另加从量税。选择时必须把这三个修正项算进去，否则会高估收益。</p>\n<h3 id=\"税率不是唯一变量\">税率不是唯一变量</h3><p>同一协定下不同原产标准可能对应不同子税目，进而适用不同税率。例如某协定对「完全获得」的产品给零关税，对「区域价值成分达标」的产品只给部分减让——这时候提高区域成分占比可以直接换税率档位。择优引擎应把「原产标准的达成程度」也当作可优化的变量，而不只是二元过滤。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从价与从量\">从价与从量</h3><p>部分品类（烟酒、部分农产品）使用从量税或复合税，节省额不能简单用税率百分比乘货值。从量税下的节省必须按数量计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Saving</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>MFN</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>FTA</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Saving} = Q \\times (t_{\\text{MFN}} - t_{\\text{FTA}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Saving</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MFN</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FTA</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是从量税率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"税率数据的来源与更新\">税率数据的来源与更新</h3><p>协定税率来自各成员的减让表与年度关税表，且逐年分阶段降税——同一个协定在不同年份的税率不同。系统必须按批次日期取当年有效税率，不能用最新税率回算历史货。ITC 与 WCO、WTO 合作运营的规则与税率查询工具以 6 位 HS 编码为检索基础，覆盖已生效、已签署与谈判中的协定，多数关税数据按年更新（<a href=\"https://findrulesoforigin.org/home/help\">ITC Rules of Origin Facilitator</a>）。这可以作为交叉校验的参考源，但正式申报仍应以目的国公布的关税表为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"达成难度的量化\">达成难度的量化</h2><h3 id=\"缺口分析\">缺口分析</h3><p>当某协定下判定为不合格时，需要知道差多少。缺口分析输出三类信息：哪条分支失败、差多少、以及可行的补救路径。例如某料件卡在 CTH 上，补救路径可能是改用区域内供应商（消除非原产材料）或调整工艺使税号改变。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;BT-EARBUD-A1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;agreement&quot;: &quot;RCEP&quot;,&#10;  &quot;verdict&quot;: &quot;NOT_QUALIFIED&quot;,&#10;  &quot;gap_analysis&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;branch&quot;: &quot;CTC-CTH&quot;, &quot;failed_material&quot;: &quot;SPK-40MM-CN&quot;, &quot;remedy&quot;: [&quot;switch_supplier:MY&quot;, &quot;redesign_housing&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;branch&quot;: &quot;RVC40&quot;, &quot;shortfall_pct&quot;: 6.4, &quot;remedy&quot;: [&quot;reclassify_cushion_as_originating&quot;, &quot;add_regional_content&quot;] }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BT-EARBUD-A1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"agreement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RCEP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"verdict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NOT_QUALIFIED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"gap_analysis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"branch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CTC-CTH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"failed_material\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SPK-40MM-CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"remedy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"switch_supplier:MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"redesign_housing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"branch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RVC40\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"shortfall_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"remedy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reclassify_cushion_as_originating\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"add_regional_content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"补救路径的可行性\">补救路径的可行性</h3><p>补救路径是否可行，取决于采购周期、工艺改造周期与供应商配合度。这些不是原产地系统内的数据，需要从采购与生产系统拉取。择优引擎应把补救路径标记为「可短期达成」「需中期改造」「不可行」三档，只对短期可达成的路径计入择优。</p>\n<h3 id=\"别为省税而重构供应链\">别为省税而重构供应链</h3><p>补救路径有时指向改供应商或改设计，这类决策的成本可能远超关税节省。工程上的正确做法是把节省额与补救成本一起呈现，由业务判断，而不是让系统自动选择「通过」的那条路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束条件\">约束条件</h2><h3 id=\"生效状态与流向\">生效状态与流向</h3><p>协定必须对「出口国到进口国」这个流向生效。RCEP 对某成员生效不代表对所有成员生效；某协定签署了但未生效不能计入候选集。候选集过滤要按流向而非按国家列表。</p>\n<h3 id=\"凭证互认\">凭证互认</h3><p>选定的协定决定了能开什么凭证，而凭证形式又可能反过来限制选择。经核准出口商可以自主声明，普通企业必须走签证机构签发证书，时效差可能决定能否赶上船期，见 <a href=\"../certificate-declaration/co-form-rcep-self-declaration\">CO/FORM 证书/RCEP 声明/经核准出口商</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"累积圈差异\">累积圈差异</h3><p>不同协定的累积圈不同，这会让同一个 BOM 在不同协定下得出不同结论。RCEP 的中日韩越累积在一个双边协定下可能完全不存在。择优引擎必须为每个候选协定<strong>独立</strong>运行一次判定，不能复用其它协定的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"择优的求解模型\">择优的求解模型</h2><h3 id=\"目标函数\">目标函数</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NetSaving</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>cert</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>remedy</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NetSaving}(a) = Q \\cdot (t_{\\text{base}} - t_a) - C_{\\text{cert}}(a) - C_{\\text{remedy}}(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetSaving</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cert</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remedy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 是候选协定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该协定下税率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>cert</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{cert}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cert</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是开证成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>remedy</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{remedy}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remedy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是把不合格补救为合格的成本。对已合格的协定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>remedy</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{remedy}} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remedy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"求解与并列处理\">求解与并列处理</h3><p>候选集通常很小（个位数），直接枚举即可，不需要复杂优化。真正需要处理的是并列与近似并列：当两个协定的净节省相差在噪声范围内时，选择应偏向<strong>核查风险更低</strong>的那个——通常意味着一开始就合格、无需补救的协定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE agreement_selection (&#10;  sku             TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  batch           TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  destination     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  candidate       TEXT NOT NULL,     -- 协定标识&#10;  qualified       BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  applied_rate    NUMERIC(6,4),&#10;  base_rate       NUMERIC(6,4),&#10;  net_saving      NUMERIC(14,2),&#10;  remedy_cost     NUMERIC(14,2),&#10;  selected        BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  reason          TEXT,&#10;  decided_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (sku, batch, destination, candidate)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> agreement_selection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  batch           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  destination     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  candidate       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 协定标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qualified       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  applied_rate    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  base_rate       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  net_saving      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  remedy_cost     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  selected        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku, batch, destination, candidate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"记录未选原因\">记录未选原因</h3><p>每一次择优都要记录落选协定与落选原因。这既是审计需要，也是运营改进的输入——如果大量 SKU 因为某个协定的某条规则卡住，那就是谈判或供应链调整的靶子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"择优结果的下游\">择优结果的下游</h2><h3 id=\"驱动凭证流程\">驱动凭证流程</h3><p>选定协定后，系统自动确定应申请的凭证类型与签发路径，并携带判定结论与证据链。这是第三章的输入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"反馈到判定引擎\">反馈到判定引擎</h3><p>择优的缺口分析会持续暴露「哪些 HS、哪些物料、哪些协定组合最容易卡住」。这些统计回流到判定引擎的规则配置优先级，也回流到供应商数据采集的目标名单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>择优的目标是最大化净节省 = 关税差额 − 开证成本 − 补救成本，而非单纯选最低税率。</li>\n<li>税率基准要处理单边优惠、零关税品类、反倾销附加三类修正。</li>\n<li>每个候选协定必须独立运行判定，累积圈不同导致结论不可复用。</li>\n<li>从量税品类按数量计算节省，不能套用从价公式。</li>\n<li>候选集小，枚举求解即可；并列时偏向核查风险更低的协定。</li>\n<li>落选协定与原因必须记录，作为供应链与谈判改进的输入。</li>\n<li>选定协定的结果决定第三章该开哪种证，见 <a href=\"../certificate-declaration/co-form-rcep-self-declaration\">CO/FORM 证书/RCEP 声明/经核准出口商</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多协定税率选择与最优享惠","id":"多协定税率选择与最优享惠"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"税率比较的正确基准","id":"税率比较的正确基准"},{"level":3,"text":"三方税率对照","id":"三方税率对照"},{"level":3,"text":"税率不是唯一变量","id":"税率不是唯一变量"},{"level":3,"text":"从价与从量","id":"从价与从量"},{"level":3,"text":"税率数据的来源与更新","id":"税率数据的来源与更新"},{"level":2,"text":"达成难度的量化","id":"达成难度的量化"},{"level":3,"text":"缺口分析","id":"缺口分析"},{"level":3,"text":"补救路径的可行性","id":"补救路径的可行性"},{"level":3,"text":"别为省税而重构供应链","id":"别为省税而重构供应链"},{"level":2,"text":"约束条件","id":"约束条件"},{"level":3,"text":"生效状态与流向","id":"生效状态与流向"},{"level":3,"text":"凭证互认","id":"凭证互认"},{"level":3,"text":"累积圈差异","id":"累积圈差异"},{"level":2,"text":"择优的求解模型","id":"择优的求解模型"},{"level":3,"text":"目标函数","id":"目标函数"},{"level":3,"text":"求解与并列处理","id":"求解与并列处理"},{"level":3,"text":"记录未选原因","id":"记录未选原因"},{"level":2,"text":"择优结果的下游","id":"择优结果的下游"},{"level":3,"text":"驱动凭证流程","id":"驱动凭证流程"},{"level":3,"text":"反馈到判定引擎","id":"反馈到判定引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"原产地资格判定引擎与规则配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-determination-data/origin-qualification-engine"},"next":{"title":"CO/FORM 证书/RCEP 声明/经核准出口商","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/certificate-declaration/co-form-rcep-self-declaration"}}